top-sort [qoh asc, i_product_name asc, i_brand asc, i_class asc, i_category asc] limit 100
└─ project (i_product_name, i_brand, i_class, i_category, qoh) (rows≈9 cost≈11.1K)
   └─ aggregate keys=[i_product_name, i_brand, i_class, i_category] aggs=[sum_0=sum, count_1=count] (rows≈9 cost≈10.4K)
      └─ project (i_product_name, i_brand, i_class, i_category, inv_quantity_on_hand) (rows≈2 cost≈9.6K)
         └─ join inner [item.i_item_sk = inventory.inv_item_sk] emit-filter 1 from right (rows≈2 cost≈9.5K)
            ├─ source item AS item use-filter 1 keys=[item.i_item_sk] (rows≈10 cost≈680)
            └─ join inner [date_dim.d_date_sk = inventory.inv_date_sk] (rows≈2 cost≈4.5K)
               ├─ filter (&& (<= 1212 |date_dim.d_month_seq|) (<= |date_dim.d_month_seq| (+ 1212 11))) (rows≈2 cost≈160)
               │  └─ source date_dim AS date_dim row-groups (&& (<= 1212 |date_dim.d_month_seq|) (<= |date_dim.d_month_seq| (+ 1212 11))) (rows≈10 cost≈80)
               └─ source inventory AS inventory (rows≈10 cost≈120)
